=> f'(gamma) < 0 throughout (0,1): C0_Bernstein(gamma,a)^2 is exact-algebra-
   proved STRICTLY DECREASING on (0,1), for every fixed a>0 (the (2+a)
   prefactor scales f but does not move the roots of f').

